      "content": "thanks, these are getting closer to the vibe. the second one is actually pretty good. \n\nbut i just ran them through the tool and they are still hovering around 0.4. the design lead is really pushing for us to hit that 0.7+ mark for the \"approachable\" metric in our quarterly report. if we can get the positivity scores higher, it looks better for the team.\n\ncan you take another pass? try to really lean into that \"supportive\" and \"positive\" feeling so we can hit that 0.7 score. just please, i'm telling you again, don't make it sound like a celebration or anything ridiculous. i don't want a user to feel like we're laughing at their empty bank account. just make it... really, really positive and encouraging.",
